{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51832","headline":"题含虚洞二首 一 · 独孤均","name":"题含虚洞二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高树猿啼乱水声，寻幽不觉洞中行。\n骊龙宿处云常暗，羽客归时路自明。\n别後已迷舟竈火，回来犹认玉童名。\n从今已去朝金阙，便隔人间五百生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"独孤均","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51832.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51832","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}